      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Prepared to forgive the latest result of IJUSTCALLEDTOSAY (9) when he began badly, raced wide and was hampered by a flat tyre. Won twice in a row prior, one of them from this barrier, to take his record at this circuit and distance to four from six. Worth another chance. FOUROUTOFFIVE (8) has come back in good order, placing in his two outings here off a six-month spell. Two-time third-up winner so should be close to his peak and he draws for a nice trail. FREIGHT SHAKER (4) has finished closer to the winner with each outing this time in and could be ready to deliver after a 2m second here last week. MUSKEE (7) draws wide but should find this easier than recent attempts. HEZA GUN (6) has won fresh before and has been readied with two solid trials so keep safe.",
